        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Octodad: Dadliest Catch is a game about destruction, deception, and fatherhood. The player controls Octodad, a dapper octopus masquerading as a human, as he goes about his life. Octodad's existence is a constant struggle, as he must master mundane tasks with his unwieldy boneless tentacles while simultaneously keeping his cephalopodan nature a secret from his human family.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Octodad: Dadliest Catch es un juego sobre la destrucción, el engaño y la paternidad. El jugador controla a Octodad, un pulcro pulpo que se hace pasar por humano mientras lleva su vida cotidiana. La existencia de Octodad es una lucha constante: debe dominar tareas mundanas con sus torpes tentáculos sin huesos y, al mismo tiempo, mantener en secreto su naturaleza de cefalópodo ante su familia humana.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
